Using Argo CD API for Automation
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Set up and configure authentication for Argo CD API access
Use the Argo CD REST API to automate application deployments
Perform automated rollbacks using API calls
Create scripts to manage Argo CD applications programmatically
Understand API endpoints and authentication mechanisms for Argo CD
